Package: HAZDist
Type: Package
Title: Distance Calculation Using Norman Abrahamson's HAZ Fortran Code
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Person", "Lin", email = "personlin@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: sf
SystemRequirements: GNU make
Description: Provides a set of R wrapper functions to call distance calculation
    functions from Norman Abrahamson's HAZ Fortran code for use in ground motion
    prediction equations (GMPEs). Computes source-to-site distance parameters
    including Rjb, Rrup, ZTOR, Rx, Ry, and Ry0.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
URL: https://github.com/personlin/HAZDist
BugReports: https://github.com/personlin/HAZDist/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Suggests: GMPEhaz
